em (hover restores; search matches stay bright)\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":18999,"length":166,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'browseSettled' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":19855,"length":9,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Ban On — raudonas × ant kortelės nebeįtraukia modelio į auto-queue\"' is not assignable to type '\"Ban On — red × on cards excludes a model from future auto-queue\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":19172,"length":76,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'browseBan' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":19941,"length":20,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Dešinis pelės mygtukas ant modelio → pause tag (laikinas). Permanent ban-by-tag: Tag Folders **Ban** stulpelis\"' is not assignable to type '\"Right-click a model → pause a tag (temporary). Permanent ban-by-tag: Tag Folders **Ban** column\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":19255,"length":126,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'browseContextSkipTag' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":20089,"length":14,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Tag Folders — Civitai tag → `\\\\*\\\\name` po kiekvienu base model (arba custom kelias). Pažymėk tagus download routing ir unsorted bibliotekos perkėlimui. **Apply to library** — perrikiuoti po priority pakeitimų; rankiniu būdu Library perkelti modeliai praleidžiami. **Mass** priskiria daug tagų vienam aplanko vardui....' is not assignable to type '\"Tag Folders — map Civitai tags to `\\\\*\\\\name` under each base model (or a custom path). Check tags to route downloads and move unsorted library models. Use **Apply to library** to re-sort after priority changes; models placed manually in Library are skipped. **Mass** assigns many tags to one folder name. No matchin...'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":19388,"length":366,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'libraryFolders' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":20469,"length":15,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Tag Folders **Priority** — kai modelis atitinka kelis tagus, laimi didesnis skaičius (▲/▼ praleidžia 0). Vienodos priority: pirmas atitinkantis tag. Priority 0 = fiksuotas auto-route. Rankiniai Library priskyrimai visada laimi.\"' is not assignable to type '\"Tag Folders **Priority** — when a model matches several tags, higher number wins (▲/▼ skip 0). Equal priorities: first matching tag. Priority 0 = fixed auto-route. Manual Library assigns always win.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":19761,"length":224,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'libraryPriority' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":20729,"length":13,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Tag Folders **Ban** — permanent ban-by-tag (skip auto-download). Laikina pause — tik Browse → Paused. Praleisti modeliai — Missing (Allow vienam modeliui).\"' is not assignable to type '\"Tag Folders **Ban** — permanent ban-by-tag (skip auto-download). Temporary pause lives only on Browse → Paused. Skipped models appear under Missing for per-model Allow.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":19992,"length":192,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'libraryTagBan' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":20915,"length":12,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Library skilties **+N** — nauji atsisiuntimai nuo paskutinio apsilankymo; atidarius Library su ženkliuku įsijungia **Session downloads**. **Show List** iš Updates vis tiek atidaro All models su pin’intu modeliu\"' is not assignable to type '\"Library tab **+N** — new downloads since your last visit; opening Library with a badge selects **Session downloads** (clears when you visit). **Show List** from Updates still opens All models pinned to that model\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":20191,"length":235,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'libraryBadge' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":21155,"length":14,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"**Session downloads** — šoninis filtras modeliams, realiai atsisiųstiems šį paleidimą (tik queue — ne disk sync / import)\"' is not assignable to type '\"**Session downloads** — sidebar filter for models actually downloaded this app run (queue completions only — not disk sync / import)\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":20433,"length":157,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'librarySession' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":21308,"length":13,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"**Atsisiųsta pagal datą** — Šiandien / Vakar / 7 dienos, arba kalendorius: viena diena, arba dvi dienos nuo–iki intervalui. Rodo, kiek atsisiuntimų atitinka pasirinkimą.\"' is not assignable to type '\"**Downloaded by date** — Today / Yesterday / Last 7 days, or the calendar: click one day, or two days for a from–to range. Shows how many downloads match the selection.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":20597,"length":192,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'libraryByDate' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":21508,"length":14,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"ℹ atidaro tą patį Model details puslapį kaip Browse — versijų perjungimas, save preview, Civitai\"' is not assignable to type '\"ℹ opens the same Model details page as Browse — switch versions, save preview, open on Civitai\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":20796,"length":119,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'libraryDetails' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":21636,"length":11,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Sort — folder tag, Civitai downloads, tag group arba download order. Tas pats Settings rezultatų rodymas (lazy / puslapiai) kaip Browse.\"' is not assignable to type '\"Sort — folder tag, Civitai downloads, tag group, or download order. Same Settings results display (lazy / pages) as Browse.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":20922,"length":14