oads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":22087,"length":14,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"**Fast tag** — priskirkite aplanką paspaustam tagui neišeidami iš Library (kelias `\\\\*\\\\name`; pakeiskite vardą pvz. glass plug → plug). Pasiūlymai grupuoti: Folders / Assigned / Library tagai.\"' is not assignable to type '\"**Fast tag** — assign a folder for the clicked tag without leaving Library (Path `\\\\*\\\\name`; change the name e.g. glass plug → plug). Suggestions group Folders / Assigned / Library tags.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":21329,"length":212,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'libraryFastTag' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":22312,"length":15,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"**Excluded** + **Ignore excluded** su **Hide folder-assigned** — palieka modelius, kurių routing tag yra Excluded (pvz. concept). **All assigned** slepia mapped tagus ant kortelių (lieka brūkšninis placeholder).\"' is not assignable to type '\"**Excluded** + **Ignore excluded** with **Hide folder-assigned** — keep models whose routing tag is in Excluded (e.g. concept). **All assigned** hides mapped tags on cards (dashed placeholder remains).\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":21548,"length":227,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'libraryExcluded' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":22556,"length":13,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"**Manual** / **Rankinis** ženklas — aplankas nustatytas rankiniu būdu; auto tag moves ir priority neperrašys, kol neišvalysite rankinio priskyrimo.\"' is not assignable to type '\"**Manual** badge — folder was set by hand; auto tag moves and priority will not re-route that model until you clear the manual assign.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":21782,"length":158,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'libraryManual' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":22734,"length":15,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Nustatymai → **Išsaugoti filtrus** — Browse/Library filtrai, rikiavimas ir show/hide checkbox lieka keičiant tabus\"' is not assignable to type '\"Settings → **Preserve filters** — keep Browse/Library filters, sort, and show/hide checkboxes when switching tabs\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":21947,"length":139,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'libraryPreserve' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly te