Text":"Type '\"Vienam modeliui — **Allow** (išimtis vs pause/ban tagai + eilė). Spauskite policy tagą (sidebar ar kortelė) — filtruojami modeliai, praleisti dėl to tago\"' is not assignable to type '\"Per model — **Allow** (exception vs pause/ban tags + queue). Click a policy tag (sidebar or card) to filter models skipped for that tag\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":22739,"length":158,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'missingAllow' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":23736,"length":13,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"**Forget On** — × ant kortelių slepia modelį visur ir nebesiūlo; **Show forgotten** peržiūrai; × vėl = Unforget\"' is not assignable to type '\"**Forget On** — × on cards hides the model everywhere and stops suggestions; **Show forgotten** to review; × again = Unforget\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":22904,"length":149,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'missingForget' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":23878,"length":15,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"**Mark seen on** — perkelkite žymeklį horizontaliai nuo ban/pause kortelės, kad pažymėtumėte kaip matytą (žalia titulinė linija). **Hide seen** checkbox paslepia pažymėtas korteles. **Unseen bans** sidebar filtras rodo tik nematytus; ką tik pažymėti lieka matomi, kol nepažymite Hide seen.\"' is not assignable to type '\"**Mark seen on** — move pointer left/right off a ban/pause card to mark seen (green title border). **Hide seen** checkbox removes marked cards. **Unseen bans** sidebar filter shows only unseen; newly marked items stay visible until you check Hide seen.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":23060,"length":278,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'missingMarkSeen' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":24200,"length":18,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"**Dešinio pelės mygtuko meniu** → Mark seen, Forget, Unban, Allow, Acknowledge, Open on Civitai — nereikia pirma įjungti toggle mygtukų.\"' is not assignable to type '\"**Right-click** a card → Mark seen, Forget, Unban, Allow, Acknowledge, or Open on Civitai — no need to toggle the toolbar buttons first.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":23345,"length":165,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'missingContextMenu' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":24372,"length":9,"code":2322,"category":