g: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":24572,"length":7,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Mėlynai žalias kraštas — naujas, ne eilėje\"' is not assignable to type '\"Teal top border — new, not queued\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":23714,"length":44,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'edgeNew' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":24632,"length":12,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Geltona — laukia prieigos / early access\"' is not assignable to type '\"Yellow — Early access\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":23765,"length":37,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'edgeAwaiting' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":24695,"length":11,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Violetinė — permanent ban-by-tag · amber — paused (Browse exclude)\"' is not assignable to type '\"Purple — permanent ban-by-tag · amber — paused (Browse exclude)\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":23809,"length":78,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'edgeBlocked' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":24783,"length":7,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Siuntimo juosta — Nustatymai → išdėstymas: **Row** (scroll kortelės), **Grid** (tinklelis), **Minimal** (kompaktinis sąrašas). Antraštė: **Auto**, **Manual**, **Pause**; **Clear queue** (Browse) išvalo eilę nekeisdama režimo.\"' is not assignable to type '\"Download strip — Settings → layout: **Row** (scroll cards), **Grid** (wrapped cards), or **Minimal** (compact list). Header: **Auto**, **Manual**, **Pause**; **Clear queue** (Browse) empties the strip without changing mode.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":23894,"length":241,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'dlStrip' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":25033,"length":14,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"**Minimal** — miniatiūra visada matoma; kairėje stulpelis su eilės/siuntimo tekstu; vertikalus skirtukas; dešinėje pavadinimas. Žalias užpildas auga tik per kairį stulpelį — pasiekus skirtuką, atsisiuntimas baigtas. Dešinis pelės mygtukas, ban ir prioritetas kaip kituose režimuose.\"' is not assignable to type '\"**Minimal** — thumbnail always visible; left column shows queue/download text; vertical separator; model name on the right. Green fill grows across the left column only — when it reaches the separator, the download is complete. Right-click, ban, and priority work like other layouts.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":24142,"length":308,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'dlStripLayouts' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":25347,"length":15,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Aktyvus siuntimas — progreso juosta ant miniatiūros; po pavadinimu pvz. 218 MB / 1.2 GB · 12 MB/s (be procentų).\"' is not assignable to type '\"Active download — progress bar on the thumbnail; below the title: e.g. 218 MB / 1.2 GB · 12 MB/s (no percentage).\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":24457,"length":139,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'dlStripProgress' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":25492,"length":13,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Tik juostos viršutinis kraštas: eilės accentas = eilėje arba siunčiama · rožinė = klaida, laukia kito bandymo · geltona = early access atrakina šiandien\"' is not assignable to type '\"Strip top border only: queue accent = queued or downloading · pink = retryable error until the next attempt starts · yellow = early access unlocks today\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":24603,"length":176,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'dlStripColors' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":25675,"length":15,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Dešinis pelės mygtukas ant juostos kortelės → Prioritetinis atsisiuntimas — perkelia į eilės priekį (arba iškart po aktyvių siuntimų)\"' is not assignable to type '\"Right-click a strip card → Priority download — moves it to the front of the queue (or right after active downloads)\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":24786,"length":141,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'dlStripPriority' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":25841,"length":11,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Status juosta — apačioje rodo eilę, greitį ir dabartinį siuntimą\"' is not assignable to type '\"Status bar — bottom of the window shows queue, speed, and current download\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":24934,"length":89,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'dlStatusBar' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":25927,"length":10,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Early access — gated download arba trūksta API rakto\"' is not assignable to type '\"Early access tab — gated download, or missing API key\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":25030,"length":67,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'dlAwaiting' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":26000,"length":12,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Incomplete — Civitai rodo modelį be versijos duomenų; recheck arba įklijuokite download URL\"' is not assignable to type '\"Incomplete tab — Civitai lists the model but version data is empty; recheck or paste a download URL\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":25104,"length":122,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'dlIncomplete' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":26121,"length":13,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Atnaujinimai — **Download** vieną kartą į eilę; **Visada atnaujinti** + ateities versijos to modelio. Jei Early access — eina į Awaiting ir neturi likti Updates. Sąrašas pildomas Harvest ir foniniu check’u. Settings → Auto-download new versions: ON = globaliai į eilę.\"' is not assignable to type '\"Updates — **Download** queues that version once; **Always update** also auto-queues future versions of that model. If the version is Early access, it moves to Awaiting and should leave Updates. Filled during Harvest and by a background library check (one API GET per owned model). Settings → Auto-download new versio...'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":25233,"length":368,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'dlNewVersions' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":26420,"length":11,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Skiltų ženkliukai — Browse: modeliai download eilėje · Library: +N nauji bibliotekoje · Atnaujinimai / Early access / Missing / Incomplete: laukiantys\"' is not assignable to type '\"Tab badges — Browse: models in the download pipeline · Library: +N new in library · Updates / Early access / Missing / Incomplete: items waiting\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":25608,"length":166,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'dlTabBadges' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":26599,"length":10,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Activity — kompaktiška filtrų juosta (paieška ir laikas kairėje, lygių/šaltinių/temų checkboxai dešinėje); spustelėkite modelio vardą → Library\"' is not assignable to type '\"Activity tab — compact filter bar (search and time on the left, level/source/topic checkboxes on the right); click a model name to jump to Library\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":25781,"length":167,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'dlActivity' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":26770,"length":11,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Browse naudoja tik civitai.red (pilnas SFW+NSFW katalogas). Brandą valdote taisyklės content filter — .com/.red hosto pasirinkimo nėra.\"' is not assignable to type '\"Browse uses civitai.red only (full SFW+NSFW catalog). Maturity is controlled per rule via content filter — there is no .com/.red host picker.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":25955,"length":163,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'domainsBody' which is declared here on type '{ readonly title: \"Guide\"; readonly openSettings: \"Open Settings →\"; readonly sections: { readonly nsfw: \"NSFW & restricted downloads\"; readonly testing: \"Testing status\"; readonly quickStart: \"Quick start (beginner)\"; ... 8 more ...; readonly progressBar: \"Catalog progress bar (Browse)\"; }; ... 62 more ...; readonl...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":26956,"length":6,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Civitai API raktas — civitai.com → Account → API Keys. Reikalingas daugumai NSFW/restricted. Saugoma lokaliai.\"' is not assignable to type '\"Civitai API key — civitai.com → Account → API Keys. Required for most NSFW/restricted downloads. Stored locally.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":26147,"length":122,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'apiKey' which is declared here on type '{ readonly apiKey: \"Civitai API key — civitai.com → Account → API Keys. Required for most NSFW/restricted downloads. Stored locally.\"; readonly modelsRoot: \"Root folder on disk — use separate LoRA and Checkpoint folders below. Tag Folders can override per model.\"; ... 27 more ...; readonly downloadStripLayout: \"Row ...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":27094,"length":10,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Atskiri LoRA ir Checkpoint aplankai. Tag Folders gali pakeisti kelią kiekvienam modeliui.\"' is not assignable to type '\"Root folder on disk — use separate LoRA and Checkpoint folders below. Tag Folders can override per model.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":26278,"length":119,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'modelsRoot' which is declared here on type '{ readonly apiKey: \"Civitai API key — civitai.com → Account → API Keys. Required for most NSFW/restricted downloads. Stored locally.\"; readonly modelsRoot: \"Root folder on disk — use separate LoRA and Checkpoint folders below. Tag Folders can override per model.\"; ... 27 more ...; readonly downloadStripLayout: \"Row ...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":27215,"length":13,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Numatyta naujoms Browse taisyklėms. NSFW/All reikia API rakto. Galima keisti per taisyklę.\"' is not assignable to type '\"Default for new Browse rules. NSFW/All needs API key. Override per rule.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":26406,"length":89,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'contentFilter' which is declared here on type '{ readonly apiKey: \"Civitai API key — civitai.com → Account → API Keys. Required for most NSFW/restricted downloads. Stored locally.\"; readonly modelsRoot: \"Root folder on disk — use separate LoRA and Checkpoint folders below. Tag Folders can override per model.\"; ... 27 more ...; readonly downloadStripLayout: \"Row ...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":27331,"length":9,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Periodinis enabled Browse taisyklių scan + auto-queue. Reikia aplanko + bent vienos On taisyklės.\"' is not assignable to type '\"Periodic scan of enabled Browse rules + auto-queue. Needs folder + at least one rule On.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file":"./src/renderer/src/i18n/en.ts","start":26504,"length":101,"messageText":"The expected type comes from property 'nightMode' which is declared here on type '{ readonly apiKey: \"Civitai API key — civitai.com → Account → API Keys. Required for most NSFW/restricted downloads. Stored locally.\"; readonly modelsRoot: \"Root folder on disk — use separate LoRA and Checkpoint folders below. Tag Folders can override per model.\"; ... 27 more ...; readonly downloadStripLayout: \"Row ...'","category":3,"code":6500}]},{"start":27450,"length":9,"code":2322,"category":1,"messageText":"Type '\"Išjungus (aktyvus Pause) vykdomi siuntimai sustabdomi; Harvest vis tiek gali pildyti eilę. Išjunkite Pause, kad pradėtų siųsti. Auto/Manual valdo ar Harvest deda modelius į eilę.\"' is not assignable to type '\"When off (Pause active), in-progress downloads stop; Harvest may still fill the queue. Turn Pause off to start sending. Auto/Manual controls whether Harvest adds models to the queue.\"'.","relatedInformation":[{"file